1
00:07:03,333 --> 00:07:09,333
He has the power to hear everything women are
thinking. Finally... a man is listening.

2
00:14:06,666 --> 00:14:12,666
What Women Want is a comedy, romance film directed by Nancy Meyers.

3
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:16,000
Advertising executive Nick Marshall is as cocky as they come, but what happens to a
chauvinistic guy when he can suddenly hear what women are thinking?

4
00:28:13,333 --> 00:28:19,333
Nick gets passed over for a promotion, but after an accident enables him to hear women's thoughts, he puts
his newfound talent to work against Darcy, his new boss, who seems to be infatuated with him.

5
00:35:16,666 --> 00:35:22,666
Nick Marshall, played by Mel Gibson.

6
00:42:20,000 --> 00:42:26,000
Darcy McGuire, played by Helen Hunt.

7
00:49:23,333 --> 00:49:29,333
Lola, played by Marisa Tomei.

8
00:56:26,666 --> 00:56:32,666
Dan Wanamaker, played by Alan Alda.

9
01:03:30,000 --> 01:03:36,000
Alex Marshall, played by Ashley Johnson.

10
01:10:33,333 --> 01:10:39,333
Morgan Farwell, played by Mark Feuerstein.

11
01:17:36,666 --> 01:17:42,666
What Women Want is a 2000 American romantic fantasy comedy film written by Josh Goldsmith, Cathy
Yuspa, and Diane Drake, directed by Nancy Meyers, and starring Mel Gibson and Helen Hunt.

12
01:24:40,000 --> 01:24:46,000
The film was released on December 15, 2000, by Paramount Pictures in the United
States and Canada and by Icon Productions in international markets.

13
01:31:43,333 --> 01:31:49,333
It received mixed reviews from critics, but was a box-office success, with a North American domestic gross of $182 million and a
worldwide gross of $374.1 million against a budget of $70 million, becoming the fourth-highest-grossing film of 2000.

14
01:38:46,666 --> 01:38:52,666
A loose remake, What Men Want, was released in 2019, starring Taraji P.

15
01:45:50,000 --> 01:45:56,000
Henson, Tracy Morgan and Aldis Hodge.

16
01:52:53,333 --> 01:52:59,333
The film explores themes of telepathy, romcom,
womanizer, single father, super power.

17
01:59:56,666 --> 02:00:02,666
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
